Device configuration snapshot: export, import, diff

Usage:
  tickerbox config [command]

Available Commands:
  diff        Show per-section field differences between the device and a saved snapshot
  export      Capture every device config section as a JSON snapshot
  import      Apply a saved config snapshot to the device

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for config

Global Flags:
  -d, --device string      named device from the config file
      --host string        TickerBox base URL (default http://tickerbox.local, or $TICKERBOX_HOST)
  -j, --json               emit raw device JSON instead of a decoded table
      --retry int          retry an idempotent request this many times on a transient failure (default 2)
      --timeout duration   per-request timeout (default 10s)

Use "tickerbox config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
